<title>ZIMBABWE: Christmas road deaths double in Zimbabwe.</title>
<headline>Christmas road deaths double in Zimbabwe.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 22 people were killed and over 200 injured in road accidents in Zimbabwe on Christmas Eve and Christmas Day, police said on Friday.</p>
<p>The casualty toll was double the same period last year. Most of the accidents are blamed on speeding.</p>
</text>
